    "Description": "### Impact\n\nAn unauthenticated request can occupy one synchronous application worker for seconds. Concurrent requests add CPU cost and can keep all workers busy, sustaining denial of service without user interaction.\n\n### Patches\n\nThe issue has been patched in versions  9.0.967 and 9.1.968-beta.\n\n### Workarounds\n\nDisallow the style attribute.",
